[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/best-armor/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/best-armor/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Best Armor[/h1]A lightweight [b]client-side Fabric mod[/b] that adds three prebuilt administrator shulker boxes and a Void Sword to the operator creative tab.
[h2]Overview[/h2]Best Armor adds four dynamically generated items to the operator-only creative tab:
[list]
[*]Yellow Shulker Box[/*]
[*]Orange Shulker Box[/*]
[*]Red Shulker Box[/*]
[*]Void Sword[/*]
[/list]The three shulker boxes contain different equipment presets:
[list]
[*]The yellow shulker box contains high-end equipment based primarily on enchantment levels obtainable in normal Survival gameplay.[/*]
[*]The orange shulker box keeps a mostly vanilla-looking equipment profile while adding normally incompatible enchantments, extreme protection levels, unbreakable items, special boots, and a shield that blocks all registered damage types.[/*]
[*]The red shulker box contains full-power administrator equipment with extreme enchantments, custom combat attributes, increased attack range, fall-damage immunity boots, and other non-Survival item components.[/*]
[/list][h2]Key Features[/h2][list]
[*]Adds three prebuilt equipment shulker boxes[/*]
[*]Adds a Void Sword[/*]
[*]Includes weapons, tools, armor, Elytra equipment, shields, and fishing rods[/*]
[/list][h2]Added Creative Items[/h2][h3]Yellow Shulker Box[/h3]The Yellow Shulker Box contains 27 equipment items intended to represent a complete high-end Survival-style loadout.
