[/list][h3]Red Shulker Box[/h3]The Red Shulker Box contains 26 full-power administrator items.
Its equipment uses extreme enchantments, custom attributes, extended interaction range, unbreakable components, and other item data that cannot normally be created in standard Survival gameplay.
[h4]Melee Weapons[/h4]The following weapons receive custom main-hand attributes:
[list]
[*]Attack Damage: +2048[/*]
[*]Attack Speed: +1024[/*]
[/list]Affected items:
[list]
[*]Netherite Sword[/*]
[*]Fortune Netherite Axe[/*]
[*]Loyalty Trident[/*]
[*]Riptide Trident[/*]
[*]Channeling Trident[/*]
[*]Netherite Spear[/*]
[*]Density Mace[/*]
[*]Wind Burst Mace[/*]
[/list]These weapons also receive an 8-block configured attack range and an additional +3 block interaction range while held in the main hand.
